  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Adds one `Gate map (#2361): covers ...` paragraph to the header of `crates/app/tests/wcs_rotation_control.rs`.\n- The paragraph names the modules from the file's `use` lines. Moved modules use their owner crate: `motion::drilling`, `geometry::geo2d`, `geometry::geometry::stock`, `tools::catalog`.\n- No code, test or other file changes.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `cargo test -p xtask -j 6`: 156 passed, 0 failed (150 bin tests, 3 + 3 in the other targets). Before the change, `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` failed on `wcs_rotation_control`.\n- CR-byte check: 0 CR bytes in the edited file.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- The quick gate of the app test suites. The change is a comment only.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2361\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
